            <div xml:id="m-b4ad6674-5111-4df9-ab99-983d3a6d153a">
              <lg xml:id="m-23911df1-3d13-44dd-b416-9ffb2a2a3c65">
                <l xml:id="m-2204d992-54b5-465e-9db7-3269a903304b" facs="#m-6561832a-a1f0-43ea-ae18-3312ea5806bd" label="text-like">23rd Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-54c8ae03-2e20-446f-b2ff-61bcbddda8be" facs="#m-e8de458f-3a79-4525-8a27-e6d10f955913" label="ambiguous">1075</l><l xml:id="m-9f1b9728-692c-4762-8fb1-28f97ebaa15a" facs="#m-d9e8f638-74bd-435f-8b3c-15eb39f11c43" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Philippenses.</l><l xml:id="m-33c0fd88-511f-4a25-9802-eb73d4fa84e0" facs="#m-3efb1c41-5820-4d83-8001-489159bfc352" label="ambiguous">Phil. 3. d. et 4.</l><l xml:id="m-5a7968f4-468a-4175-b53f-79532c319997" facs="#m-8304cb58-2172-4740-969d-890d0c04a88c" label="lyrics-like">HRatres: Imitatóres mei estóte,] configurátum córporiclaritátissuae,</l><l xml:id="m-c309181d-a3c2-481d-a898-085615b7483a" facs="#m-b4b0e338-81ba-4a92-95ae-26015af4ce10" label="lyrics-like">Fet observáte eos, qui ita ám¬</l><l xml:id="m-d4b510c3-0c85-42dc-8408-8c80c999f12a" facs="#m-3d6a875f-b557-4fce-a2e9-ea82db788214" label="lyrics-like">secúndum operatiónem, qua étiam</l><l xml:id="m-f1f2bcde-3dca-484b-b3fc-2f2b10bc477c" facs="#m-a2bd0284-cf2b-41f2-8a86-85391aea3468" label="lyrics-like">bulant, sicut habétis formam no¬</l><l xml:id="m-248fb92a-d5a9-4820-bdaf-99d41da779cc" facs="#m-b57e6810-1733-480b-82bf-c79bd1a69cee" label="lyrics-like">possit subjicere sibi ómniã. Itaque,</l><l xml:id="m-50c783eb-9af0-4aa0-a519-8ffca9de9ea1" facs="#m-54791e9d-a364-4a11-95b3-17df4d537bc1" label="lyrics-like">stram. Multi enim ámbulant, quos</l><l xml:id="m-6c8b7b2d-48e4-44ab-a5ac-41ea97e5c136" facs="#m-fa53f58b-1701-4f11-ae87-ca765fc8dbaa" label="ambiguous">fratres mei carissimi et desideratis¬</l><l xml:id="m-489d2caa-549c-4a74-aaca-e14c39a340c0" facs="#m-8e8a7ae7-310f-4676-82c3-fa72c7f220ad" label="lyrics-like">saepe dicébam vobis (nunc autem</l><l xml:id="m-00bd2114-4b6d-45e0-a2fb-5659d4172312" facs="#m-648c54b7-7008-460a-9100-7a857782408c" label="lyrics-like">simi, gáudium meum, et coróna</l><l xml:id="m-7ccfe09f-5b90-4bad-b008-8ac3d0b83e76" facs="#m-ad935623-4c74-47c2-8879-95cb0c0d8702" label="lyrics-like">et flens dico) inimícos crucis Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c1de09c-f9f2-481b-a7ef-47756222e6b1" facs="#m-2fd23f98-e449-4a1b-a805-9a28d60adfa0" label="lyrics-like">mea: sic state in Dómino, caris¬</l><l xml:id="m-1ddcadae-9779-40ac-8242-9cf1dd098aa1" facs="#m-db5d2a98-fcd4-45b7-9efe-e89d06d3c9ee" label="lyrics-like">sti: quorum finis intéritus: quo¬</l><l xml:id="m-824db3fa-afb0-43a2-935e-30cde35a4ddf" facs="#m-d6f38194-cd12-4374-9155-79166b7cba20" label="lyrics-like">simi. Evódiam rogo, et Syntychen</l><l xml:id="m-62cf2f12-c4f2-4503-8174-808009cacc37" facs="#m-5c843eaa-b1b8-4c39-8799-e4e150a18055" label="lyrics-like">rum Deus venter est: et glória in</l><l xml:id="m-3de9392c-5ae1-4246-a353-3a725afcfa72" facs="#m-4d692d91-0cb8-45a7-825a-df02ad2fec16" label="lyrics-like">déprecor idipsum sápere in Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e9535902-fc40-4204-8d1c-516bd593780c" facs="#m-06ffd8dd-9b68-47e3-a456-1ddf2a53ece5" label="lyrics-like">confusióne ipsórum, qui terréna</l><l xml:id="m-39f60a69-d78c-47ae-84ee-0686ad316d66" facs="#m-4d478d35-d10e-4d5e-89e4-c97d7fd0a7e6" label="lyrics-like">no. Etiam rogo et te, germáne com¬</l><l xml:id="m-523f95d0-3ab3-478c-add9-1ad12acd3736" facs="#m-4113d8be-02ce-4492-92c1-698d437851eb" label="lyrics-like">par, ádjuva illas, quae mecum la¬</l><l xml:id="m-f6b59ad5-0988-469e-a2a2-a7ada34b431c" facs="#m-6c62f39f-de2c-42e6-a7fd-8547fc288356" label="lyrics-like">sápiunt. Nostra autem conversátio</l><l xml:id="m-ff9741ce-1b65-4793-be69-e6ef52b9b3c1" facs="#m-24e49f7e-013f-4b23-8956-024ef7b9c040" label="lyrics-like">in caelis est: unde étiam Salva¬</l><l xml:id="m-f44f4604-69e4-455e-9a5b-2f84f7e42f04" facs="#m-c28e6591-d050-4582-b8fb-56b419372407" label="lyrics-like">boravérunt in Evangélio cum Cle¬</l><l xml:id="m-c0ad8a36-2d5a-4ffa-9ec4-c0e4ef9f2395" facs="#m-a674870b-abd9-471a-a939-cf6141505a39" label="lyrics-like">tórem exspectámus Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-93a4e2c5-1bfa-4b14-9fd3-77ffc74d4d99" facs="#m-4b20114c-7c42-4ed6-bdac-7518758d3fa4" label="lyrics-like">ménte, et céteris adjutóribus meis,</l><l xml:id="m-eb254ea3-0e94-48f7-8b90-70b67a6de8b1" facs="#m-b2dd3529-4ca4-4bda-aa07-7c68df1630c6" label="lyrics-like">strum Jesum Christum, qui refor- quorum nómina sunt in libro vitae.</l><l xml:id="m-b3d9477c-93cc-4027-a51f-b0c8a1e30201" facs="#m-5636bb68-796b-4dad-b055-56089541aba9" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-b01b769e-7e01-4ba3-a40d-373696273002" facs="#m-3697e735-f29b-4687-b5d1-4d53cf1fd470" label="lyrics-like">mábit corpus humilitátis nostrae,</l><l xml:id="m-e883cbdf-32a0-4d9d-8461-28e0163ec363" facs="#m-23d66a49-bc30-414e-9a06-905d69f1bbcc" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-0abcaf91-f789-4340-b884-25b126d17869" facs="#m-b42ccab1-a13e-44e2-85c9-42f5d925ce27" label="ambiguous">I.</l><l xml:id="m-79f78919-4c18-42b0-838e-47f0dd37aafa" facs="#m-65b4a757-5fbd-4615-af11-7f9bd636b25d" label="lyrics-like">AIbe-rásti nos,</l><l xml:id="m-1ec0dd62-9d6e-4096-a7b6-fdb35d87b473" facs="#m-03e64442-4f12-466b-ab68-2dd9e4cf6ef6" label="lyrics-like">*Dó- mine,</l><l xml:id="m-c8dd5f22-c663-464d-a55d-2c084c45e001" facs="#m-f564aef8-f412-4547-bb46-b764d6d92275" label="ambiguous">ex af-fli¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d6b35e8-c966-4a48-b5f2-0a1e93de81ca" facs="#m-7730f7d7-6a35-4cd7-a16e-57cc3c7e977a" label="lyrics-like">géntibus</l><l xml:id="m-90b2294b-2cc9-44a4-b4fa-364bbfd8d0dc" facs="#m-8d184767-28a1-4837-9b50-afb99d805a65" label="lyrics-like">et é-os qui nos odé¬</l><l xml:id="m-61862cb3-cf91-4ab3-84e2-963a447837a9" facs="#m-8802467a-eb9e-4cde-9c4d-1a9fd5db9144" label="ambiguous">runt,</l><l xml:id="m-3d463c43-ea98-4b67-a97e-d404905be8ba" facs="#m-305308e5-039b-4bb4-b6d2-9f1d4c61d97b" label="ambiguous">nos:</l><l xml:id="m-0f32d64a-dddf-4f25-8d80-b4fa2ad84e7b" facs="#m-3a6d399f-751b-4d36-a7ff-468cda6f5d8e" label="lyrics-like">V. In Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-caf849c4-0959-45a1-ba99-72a3af64a871" facs="#m-a8d4d415-1302-4d20-a2e3-4547348b03d5" label="lyrics-like">dí-sti.</l><l xml:id="m-49e4c952-2d98-4059-8dc9-f82a05f83a02" facs="#m-dd364f0b-26d1-449d-bd51-bfb766dcb8f9" label="ambiguous">con-fu¬</l><l xml:id="m-31e02eaf-cbe4-4b77-8c89-e457c2d2f150" facs="#m-7f90e3b8-5938-40fd-8af4-9db510f7b3f3" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-b4d68193-f577-4167-a0fb-3a24d4590fe4" facs="#m-72d86d19-053e-43b2-a913-01729de43a6b" label="lyrics-like">laudábimur</l><l xml:id="m-40de7fba-7052-4a86-a6ba-985e95b05e50" facs="#m-1a873021-757b-41e3-b22d-be5dbf71973a" label="lyrics-like">et nó-mimni tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b11bc95-19f1-478b-8152-96d79719c2af" facs="#m-5320d6d1-424d-4495-a724-8d9588a15dd8" label="lyrics-like">tó¬ ta</l><l xml:id="m-a68e70b7-48aa-4873-ba86-276d26b2753b" facs="#m-b256c49b-283f-4156-90cc-cae0f22fe3e6" label="lyrics-like">dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-9fb7d530-8f2b-4f7c-b92a-8c9e055771d8" facs="#m-025b22ac-f992-45ac-b366-77888e4b3f6e" label="ambiguous">e,</l><l xml:id="m-3c5109e2-12d8-43c2-8f0d-f95734661a93" facs="#m-0ca7f8e6-fbc6-4fbf-9964-80f17edc736a" label="lyrics-like">confité- bi- mur "in saé-cu¬ la.</l></lg>
